Description: htop with Simplified Chinese user interface
 htop 3.4.1 patched with a Simplified Chinese interface, covering the
 main screen, the help page, the setup screens and the common dialogs.
 .
 The included binary is statically linked (musl) and needs no runtime
 dependencies. Use HTOP_LANG=zh (or an UTF-8 Chinese locale) for the
 Chinese interface, HTOP_LANG=en keeps the original English UI.
